{"product_id":"the-two-of-us-my-life-with-john-thaw","title":"The Two of Us : My Life With John Thaw","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen John Thaw, the star of The Sweeney and Inspector Morse, died from cancer in 2002, the nation lost one of its finest actors and Sheila Hancock lost a beloved husband. In this double biography she chronicles their lives, both before they met and after their marriage in 1974. It is story of a love that survived celebrity, overwork, drink and cancer, poignantly interwoven with excerpts from Sheila's diary for the last year of their life together. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Sheila Hancock \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780747570202 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45073885003929,"sku":"12RA9780747570202","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/678b82191f5e3-The_20Two_20of_20Us_20-_20My_20Life_20With_20John_20Thaw_20Sheila_20Hancock.jpg?v=1737210648","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-two-of-us-my-life-with-john-thaw","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}